&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-doxusoQAFrm9Wghp6tXr7E6j42g&quot;&gt;ole Overview&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus390vWmL4c44aotBO4uOLkf&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Web3 Content Creator &amp;amp; Product Education Specialist to produce educational articles and guides, script and present videos, and create supporting course materials that help users understand, explore and activate products across the Bybit ecosystem.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuspJXVpWpYEeafghFMV15wJc&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on content execution role. The successful candidate must have proven experience producing written educational content and scripting, presenting and hosting video content within crypto, blockchain, trading or Web3.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxus7ThyXfWsc1Z7T9OjpWHSjh&quot;&gt;The role will work closely with business units, product teams and the Learn team to turn new products, features, token listings and platform updates into clear written content, tailored videos, tutorials and supporting educational materials.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxuseNNjS0tstwEzDH9RRR3jLf&quot;&gt;The objective is not only to explain how Bybit products work, but also to help users confidently take the next step and use them.&lt;/div&gt;
