&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;translation-13&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Responsible for developing and executing penetration testing, red-blue confrontation, and practical attack and defense drills that simulate real attack scenarios, identifying potential security risks in enterprise networks, applications, cloud environments, work networks, and core business systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
