&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;translation-17&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Based on the real attack chain design exercise scenario, covering extranet breakthrough, web vulnerability exploitation, phishing entrance, privilege escalation, lateral movement, Data Discovery, privilege maintenance, and defense bypass stages.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
