&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;translation-41&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Participate in the construction of AI security protection plan, including prompt word security policy, content security detection, tool call permission constraints, sensitive data desensitization, audit tracking, Agent sandbox isolation and security evaluation benchmark construction.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
