&lt;div data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;About the Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;We are looking for a dedicated and proactive VIP Relationship Manager (VIP RM) to join our Poland team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;As a VIP RM, you will play a key role in expanding our base of VIP clients with a focus on Poland. This role is focused on active traders, high-net-worth individuals (HNWIs), family offices,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;prop trading&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; desks, and smaller corporate clients, driving our growth through partnerships and key client development in parallel to our institutional team, which, on the other hand, focuses on larger professional, enterprise and institutional clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;10&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;11&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Your primary goal will be to drive trading volume and maximize Assets Under Management (AUM) in the region through onboarding and retention of VIP clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;13&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Revenue and Product Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate a revenue strategy and optimization plan based on OKX&#39;s European product offerings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with the product team to gather client feedback, identify optimization opportunities, and enhance relevant product features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Leadership and Partnerships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with local executive leadership to contribute to the company&#39;s overall strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead partnership efforts in Europe — identify suitable partners and execute negotiations to expand reach and revenue streams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Management and Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with HNWIs and key clients in Europe, ensuring positive customer experiences through proactive account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long-lasting client relationships to secure referrals and originate new prospects, working with operations to address roadblocks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance and Brand Advocacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee legal and compliance aspects, including regulatory adherence, client KYC/AML processes, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a brand ambassador, educating customers on OKX&#39;s full value proposition (trading tools to yield products), while escalating feedback to improve platform compliance and user experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;34&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;35&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;36&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;What We Look For In You&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rich-text-paragraph&quot; data-eleid=&quot;37&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;38&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Core Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;richTextDocs-unOrderList richTextDocs-unOrderList-disc&quot; data-eleid=&quot;39&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;40&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;41&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Marketing, Finance, or a related field (or equivalent professional experience in fintech/crypto).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;42&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;43&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Fluency in English and Polish, with additional CEE languages (e.g., Russian, Ukrainian) considered a strong plus for regional client engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
