&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;48&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;5+ years of proven experience in VIP business development and account management within crypto, fintech, trading, or wealth management, ideally in Poland or CEE.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
