&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;54&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Strong analytical skills to interpret market data, user behavior metrics, and performance dashboards for revenue optimization and product feedback loops.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
