&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;66&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;67&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;In-depth understanding of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;MiCA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;MFSA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, AML/KYC, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;EDD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;, and CEE financial regulations, including cross-border licensing and risk management.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
