&lt;li class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem&quot; data-eleid=&quot;68&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;richTextDocs-listItem__text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot; data-eleid=&quot;69&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt;Proven ability to collaborate with legal, product, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only text-with-abbreviation text-with-abbreviation-bottomline&quot;&gt;ops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;text-only&quot;&gt; teams to mitigate compliance risks while enhancing client experiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
