descriptions.job-0mnpraa:
&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn&#39;t work together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we&#39;ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We&#39;re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Sales Manager to lead our growing team of Account Executives and increase revenue against individual, team and overall Sales goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an experienced people manager with sales experience, you will lead a successful remote Sales team that generates success for our sellers and Square. You&#39;ll use insights and data to support and coach your AEs, while building a team culture of high performance, ownership and accountability. Your entrepreneurial approach will be a valuable contribution to developing our strategy, growing the team, and establishing a culture of crisp execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We expect this individual to work with a team of remote AEs to co-sell and generate revenue for Square. You will have an active role representing Sales across internal teams, working together with leadership on strategy definition and sales plans. As a brand ambassador for Square, you&#39;ll help drive our mission while managing and developing your team of Account Executives to achieve their full potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Will&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a team culture of trust, accountability, success and fun where people are encouraged to share information, constructively debate, and communicate freely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support direct reports by participating in client and prospect meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a sales team which includes hiring and training new account executives on sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote rigorous sales development execution and oversight, and KPI management including hourly/daily metrics, forecasting, and pipeline management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build predictable and repeatable sales funnel processes and best practices across team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct weekly pipeline review and forecast meetings with AEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach direct reports regarding strategies to increase revenue and customer success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve the sales strategy, process and tactics to improve performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the customer voice to improve our products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Envision new ideas and approaches and take them to fruition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You Have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2-3+ years of sales management experience, leading quota-carrying Account Executives or full-cycle sellers is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years of documented sales success as an individual contributor exceeding target&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in hiring, training and ramping new Account Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in collaborating across different teams with the ability to inspire change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership and coaching experience and a desire to help others be their best&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in creating structure around sales metrics and managing yourself and others to achieve these metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of how to refine decision-making and consider the downstream and upstream effects of potential decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Block takes a market-based approach to pay, and pay may vary depending on your location. U.S. locations are categorized into one of four zones based on a cost of labor index for that geographic area. The successful candidate&#39;s starting pay will be determined based on job-related skills, experience, qualifications, work location, and market conditions. These ranges may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone A:&amp;nbsp;$163,600—$245,400 USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone B:&amp;nbsp;$152,200—$228,200 USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone C:&amp;nbsp;$144,000—$216,000 USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone D:&amp;nbsp;$135,800—$203,600 USD&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amounts listed above include target variable compensation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To find a location&#39;s zone designation, please refer to this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/salaryzones.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;resource&lt;/a&gt;. If a location of interest is not listed, please speak with a recruiter for additional information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is a proud equal opportunity employer. We work hard to evaluate all employees and job applicants consistently, based solely on the core competencies required of the role at hand, and without regard to any legally protected class. We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible. &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about what we&#39;re doing to build an inclusive workplace? Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/news/inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Inclusion &amp;amp; Diversity page.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-time employee benefits include the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare coverage (Medical, Vision and Dental insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Savings Account and Flexible Spending Account&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Plans including company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness programs, including access to mental health, 1:1 financial planners, and a monthly wellness allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental and caregiving leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off (including 12 paid holidays)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid sick leave (1 hour per 26 hours worked (max 80 hours per calendar year to the extent legally permissible) for non-exempt employees and covered by our Flexible Time Off policy for exempt employees)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and Development resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Life insurance, AD&amp;amp;D, and disability benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;These benefits are further detailed in Block&#39;s policies. This role is also eligible to participate in Block&#39;s equity plan subject to the terms of the applicable plans and policies, and may be eligible for a sign-on bonus. Sales roles may be eligible to participate in a commission plan subject to the terms of the applicable plans and policies. Pay and benefits are subject to change at any time, consistent with the terms of any applicable compensation or benefit plans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-03nutnm:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to do the most impactful work of your career? At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/?utm_campaign=mt_o_m_w_m_m__coi_0_jd-onchain&amp;amp;utm_source=coinbase&quot;&gt;Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;, we are uncompromising on our mission to increase economic freedom. The bar is high, the environment is intense, and we like it that way. This isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it’s a place to be pushed past your perceived limits. If you&#39;re ready to build the future of finance alongside people who refuse to settle for &quot;good enough,&quot; you belong here. Coinbase is a remote-first, but not remote-only company. Expect to get together quarterly for intense in-person working sessions called “surges.”&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/careers&quot;&gt;learn more about working at Coinbase&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As an HR Business Partner on the People team, you&#39;ll partner with one or more functional leadership teams to translate business strategy into people and org strategy. You&#39;ll own the full HRBP lifecycle for your client groups, from org design and performance management to employee development and retention, using data and sound judgment to directly influence how Coinbase scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own people programs and strategies for your client group, including performance management, compensation, talent development, engagement, and retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with functional leaders on org design, workforce planning, and people strategies that support business objectives at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead coaching and counsel for leaders on professional development, career pathing, leveling, change management, and sensitive people situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive data-informed people insights by analyzing trends and translating them into actionable recommendations for leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and apply HR policies with an eye toward compliance and risk reduction, managing employee relations issues across global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen cross-functional partnerships across People Team COEs to ensure cohesive delivery of people programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in Talent Management, Organizational Effectiveness, Recruiting Leadership, Talent Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, Consulting, Chief of Staff, or HR, with direct experience advising senior leaders on org and people strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record navigating complex stakeholder situations with sound judgment, including performance issues, restructures, and sensitive employee matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using people data (engagement surveys, attrition metrics, performance trends) to build recommendations and influence leadership decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of designing and executing people programs end-to-end (e.g., performance cycles, talent reviews, org redesigns) with measurable business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High integrity and discretion when handling confidential information across all levels of the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Utilizes generative AI responsibly, maintaining human oversight to deliver business-ready outputs and drive measurable improvements in workflow efficiency, cost, and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Position ID:&amp;nbsp; P77342&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Base salary varies by location (see range below). Total compensation may also include equity and bonus eligibility, and benefits (medical, dental, vision, 401(k)).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual base salary range (excluding equity and bonus):&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$176,035&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$207,100 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Application Limit: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Candidates may submit a maximum of 3 applications within a 6-month period.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer: &lt;/strong&gt;Coinbase is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. Applicants with criminal histories will be considered consistent with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Applicants: &lt;/strong&gt;View&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/WHD/legacy/files/eppac.pdf&quot;&gt; Employee Rights&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12.pdf&quot;&gt; Know Your Rights&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://static-assets.coinbase.com/e-verify.pdf&quot;&gt; E-Verify&lt;/a&gt; Notice of Participation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Accommodations: &lt;/strong&gt;If you are an individual with a disability who needs a reasonable accommodation, email us your request and contact info at accommodations[at]coinbase.com.&amp;nbsp;Need screen reading technology?&lt;a href=&quot;https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/screen-reader/kgejglhpjiefppelpmljglcjbhoiplfn&quot;&gt; Click here&lt;/a&gt; to download a free compatible screen reader and view the&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.chromevox.com/tutorial/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;tutorial&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic; font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy &amp;amp; Arbitration: &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/applicant_privacy_notice&quot;&gt; Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. US applicants: By submitting your application, you agree to&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coinbase.com/legal/application-arbitration-agreement&quot;&gt; Arbitration of Disputes&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;fortidlp-input-element-parent&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-19u7h9e:
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about-privy&quot;&gt;Who we are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Privy&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to make privacy and user ownership the default online. To do so, we build simple, flexible APIs and tools for developers that make it easy to build new products on crypto rails.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Privy owns the abstractions and infrastructure layer above wallets, integrating across chains, third-party providers, and Stripe products like Treasury and Link. We get to solve hard technical problems while leveraging Stripe&#39;s distribution to reach customers like Ramp, Klarna, Deel, Kraken, Hyperliquid, and Fomo — powering experiences for both mainstream users and crypto natives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineering at Privy is distinguished by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High urgency: Shipping very small iterations, very fast, to learn very quickly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product taste: Our customers &lt;em&gt;are&lt;/em&gt; developers, and to build effective products for them requires technical knowledge - you will often be &quot;the PM&quot;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security mindset: A great portion of our product is trust. While we have a dedicated security team, every engineer brings security to their designs from the start.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In practice, we use&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://mcfunley.com/choose-boring-technology&quot;&gt;boring technology&lt;/a&gt; like Node, React, and AWS so we can focus our engineering energy entirely on pushing the boundaries of Privy&#39;s core product, e.g. through hardware enclaves, multi-region low latency APIs, and blockchain abstractions that are accessible to mainstream developers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what-youll-do&quot;&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll lead Privy’s Wallet Platform team, a product-minded platform group building the primitives and developer-facing surfaces behind Privy’s wallet product that helps our users transact more than $18B monthly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The team works on everything ranging from deep wallet infrastructure like AWS Nitro Enclaves, to developer APIs, webhooks, and secure transaction submission. You’ll balance new capabilities with targeted reliability and scale work, setting technical direction while keeping the team close to the developer and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, TLM-shaped engineering management role. You’ll grow a small team, stay close to architecture and execution, and help Privy make sound platform investments as the product scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the technical direction for the platform capabilities that underpin Privy’s wallet product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive four nines uptime and own the reliability, performance, usability, and evolution of Privy’s wallet system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with Product, Security, and other engineering teams to define durable interfaces and turn platform needs into clear roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and ship systems in weeks that will last years&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay close to the work by reviewing pull requests and design documents, helping scope technical initiatives, and stepping into complex technical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a team culture that values technical rigor, ownership, urgency, and thoughtful operational practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a thoughtful people leader shaping careers, coaching your team and those around you, and learning from others invested in your success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Who you are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong ownership and care deeply about business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a performance-oriented mindset and a high bar for quality and excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep backend or platform experience and can independently evaluate architecture, systems tradeoffs, and technical feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand that a platform is a product. You can connect decisions about interfaces, reliability, performance, and migrations to developer, customer, and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can set technical direction for a platform that must serve multiple product needs, while maintaining clear boundaries and a durable architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience leading and developing engineers, and understand that strong management requires active practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay close to architecture and execution, including design reviews, code review, and complex technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working through ambiguity and balancing long-term platform foundations with immediate product needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with wallet, custody, signing, crypto infrastructure, or consequential platform decision-making is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

descriptions.job-0kha9sy:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;BitGo (NYSE: BTGO) is the digital asset infrastructure company delivering custody, wallets, staking, trading, financing, stablecoins, and settlement services from regulated cold storage. Since 2013, BitGo has focused on accelerating the transition of the financial system to a digital asset economy. BitGo maintains a global presence and multiple regulated entities, including BitGo Bank &amp;amp; Trust, National Association, the first federally chartered digital asset trust bank owned by a publicly traded company. Today, BitGo serves thousands of institutions, including many of the industry&#39;s top brands, financial institutions, exchanges, and platforms, and millions of investors worldwide. For more information, visit &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.bitgo.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.bitgo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role will require being full-time onsite at our San Francisco office to support collaborative team dynamics and innovative problem-solving.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Crypto is becoming real financial infrastructure and BitGo has spent more than a decade building the products making that transition possible. Since 2013, we’ve built infrastructure that institutions use to custody, trade, stake, settle, and move digital assets. We’ve operated through every market cycle, expanded around the world, earned the trust of thousands of institutions, and become a publicly traded company along the way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And we’re still early.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Product Marketing Manager to help define what comes next: how new products enter the market, how clients understand them, how Sales sells them, and ultimately how BitGo tells its story as digital assets become part of mainstream finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role for someone who wants ownership. We’re building at the center of a financial system that is changing in real time, and no two days look the same. You’ll work with the smartest people in the industry to turn complex products and ambitious ideas into simple, compelling stories and bring them to market.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role is full-time onsite at one of our BitGo hubs. We believe the best GTM work happens when you’re in the room with Product, Sales, and other stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Positioning and messaging: &lt;/strong&gt;Figure out what makes our products matter and develop positioning that is differentiated, memorable, and useful, from the one-sentence pitch to the full product narrative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM strategy and launches: &lt;/strong&gt;Own launches alongside Product from idea to adoption. Define the audience and narrative, build the GTM strategy, align teams around it, bring products to market, and keep pushing after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitive and market intelligence:&lt;/strong&gt; Understand competitors, market structure, client needs, and emerging trends, then turn that intelligence into sharper positioning, better product decisions, and new commercial opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales enablement: &lt;/strong&gt;Give Sales the stories and tools they need to win, and turn insights from the field into sharper positioning and GTM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Be the connective tissue between Product, Sales, Marketing, Design, and other teams. Some of the most important opportunities won’t arrive with a perfectly written brief. You’ll turn ambiguity into strategy and strategy into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The BitGo narrative: &lt;/strong&gt;Help define how BitGo shows up in the world. Partner across Content, Growth, PR, and IR to tell the story of a public company operating at the center of a rapidly changing financial system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-negotiables:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We care more about what you’ve done and how you think than checking every box. But you’ll probably thrive here if you have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4–7 years of product marketing or closely related experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with meaningful launches you’ve personally driven from strategy through execution, not just supported.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional positioning instinct&lt;/strong&gt;s. You can find the simplest, sharpest articulation of why a complicated product matters now.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A commercial mindset.&lt;/strong&gt; You care about adoption, revenue, clients, and winning, not just shipping marketing assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High agency.&lt;/strong&gt; When something is unclear, you investigate. When something is missing, you build it. When something could be better, you say so.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ability to cross organizational boundaries and get people moving&lt;/strong&gt;, even when you don’t formally own the teams involved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An AI-forward approach&lt;/strong&gt;. You already use AI to research, think, write, analyze, and work faster, and you want to push that even further.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort operating in ambiguity&lt;/strong&gt; and moving quickly without sacrificing judgment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent writing and storytelling skills&lt;/strong&gt;, with the ability to turn technical products and complex ideas into narratives people immediately understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in crypto, fintech, financial services, banking, or high-growth technology is helpful, but not required. &lt;strong&gt;Curiosity about how money and markets are changing is.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join BitGo?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There aren&#39;t many opportunities to join a company with more than a decade of history that still feels like it&#39;s entering its most important chapter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BitGo is publicly traded, federally chartered, and operates around the world. Our infrastructure sits behind institutions building in digital assets today, and the market we serve is expanding as crypto, stablecoins, tokenization, and traditional financial markets increasingly converge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That creates an unusual PMM challenge: established company, emerging category, sophisticated customers, complex products, and a lot of white space still left to define. If you want your GTM work to matter at scale and help lead the tradition to the digital asset economy, this is the place to be.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive base salary, bonus, and stock options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;100% company-paid health insurance for employee, partner, and dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Up to 4% 401k company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave, Paid vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free commuter/parking pass&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free custom lunches, dinners, and snacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Computer equipment and workplace furniture to suit your needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great colleagues and an inspiring startup environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits may vary based on location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Pay Transparency Notice:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending upon your leveling and location, the compensation for this role averages between $130,000 and $150,000 USD base salary. Equity, an annual performance bonus, and the benefits outlined above are also part of this role’s package.&lt;/p&gt;

descriptions.job-10hhgyq:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is a US-headquartered, global leader in agent-first brokerage infrastructure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for stocks, ETFs, options, crypto, fixed income, 24/5 trading, and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Amongst our subsidiaries, Alpaca is a licensed financial services company, serving hundreds of financial institutions across 40 countries with our institutional-grade APIs. This includes broker-dealers, investment advisors, wealth managers, hedge funds, and crypto exchanges, totalling over 10 million brokerage accounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our global team is a diverse group of experienced engineers, traders, and brokerage professionals who are working to achieve our mission of opening financial services to everyone on the planet. We&#39;re deeply committed to open-source contributions and fostering a vibrant community, continuously enhancing our award-winning, developer-friendly API and the robust infrastructure behind it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Alpaca is proudly backed by $400 million in funding from top-tier global investors including Portage Ventures, Spark Capital, Tribe Capital, Social Leverage, Horizons Ventures, Opera Tech Ventures, SBI Group, Derayah Financial, Unbound, Peak XV, Elefund, and Y Combinator.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Team Members:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re a dynamic team of 400+ globally distributed members who thrive working from our favorite places around the world, with teammates spanning the USA, Canada, Japan, Hungary, Nigeria, Brazil, the UK, and beyond!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re searching for passionate individuals eager to contribute to Alpaca&#39;s rapid growth. If you align with our core values—Stay Curious, Have Empathy, and Be Accountable—and are ready to make a significant impact, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;[inlineExtension]Your-Role:&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0243c49ba49f&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2416&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Your Role:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are hiring a Team Lead in Singapore who brings Staff-level technical depth and people leadership: you will guide engineers building brokerage and platform services for New Markets in the region, partner with global teams, and represent engineering for Singapore stakeholders. Scope involves responsibility around architecture, APIs, reliability, mentorship, regional recruitment support, with emphasis on leading the Singapore team day to day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;[inlineExtension]What-you-will-do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;20b3c5eef8d9&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2877&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Things you get to do:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;Technical-architecture-and-delivery&quot; data-local-id=&quot;73aee68e776b&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2896&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Technical architecture and delivery&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2935&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b7dab0d2d93e&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Architect and ship scalable, mission-critical brokerage systems (gRPC microservices, REST/gRPC APIs, vendor integrations).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2935&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b7dab0d2d93e&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Advance the core platform for multi-region, multi-currency, and regulatory context globally.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2935&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b7dab0d2d93e&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Own API quality, performance, and operational readiness for regional workloads.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3240&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c2fd8f27ad96&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Leadership and people&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3265&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bfe753a52048&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead, coach, and develop engineers in Singapore; set clarity on priorities, quality bar, and career growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3265&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bfe753a52048&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Partner with recruiting on regional hiring and interviews.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3265&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bfe753a52048&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Facilitate knowledge sharing and engineering culture across Alpaca.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3509&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5fb93ffc2904&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Operational excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3535&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77ab20befde7&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Act as a senior escalation for incidents affecting regional stacks; improve monitoring, alerting, and incident response.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3535&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77ab20befde7&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Participate in on-call as appropriate for the team’s coverage model.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8b926221d2bc&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Stakeholder collaboration&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3760&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e354ff1d5ae9&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Work with Product, Compliance, and local stakeholders on Singapore and regional requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3760&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e354ff1d5ae9&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborate across time zones with US and other regional engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;[inlineExtension]What-we-look-for-(Must-Haves):&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3fc871f50721&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3936&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What we look for (Must-Haves):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3971&quot; data-local-id=&quot;273e9219e516&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong backend engineering (Go or equivalent) and distributed systems at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3971&quot; data-local-id=&quot;273e9219e516&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Staff-level impact: architecture ownership, cross-team technical leadership, mentoring.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3971&quot; data-local-id=&quot;273e9219e516&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;People leadership experience: direct or matrix leadership of engineers (1:1s, performance, delivery).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3971&quot; data-local-id=&quot;273e9219e516&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Financial services / fintech / brokerage exposure: trading lifecycle, settlements, regulatory awareness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3971&quot; data-local-id=&quot;273e9219e516&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent communication in English; comfort with regional and global stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;[inlineExtension]Who-You-Might-Be-(Nice-To-Haves):&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d914061992c5&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4444&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Who You Might Be (Nice-To-Haves):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4482&quot; data-local-id=&quot;effd5e7546e5&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in Singapore or &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;APAC&lt;/span&gt; regulatory and market context.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4482&quot; data-local-id=&quot;effd5e7546e5&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Microservices, Kubernetes, cloud (GCP/AWS), event-driven design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4482&quot; data-local-id=&quot;effd5e7546e5&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Open-source or strong community presence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Take Care of You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive Salary &amp;amp; Stock Options&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;Health Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New Hire Home-Office Setup: One-time USD $500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Monthly Stipend: USD $150 per month via a Brex Card&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Alpaca is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace dedicated to pursuing and hiring a diverse workforce.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://files.alpaca.markets/disclosures/AlpacaRecruitmentPrivacyPolicy.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

descriptions.job-1a4vqxu:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Stripe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to the most ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow their revenue, and accelerate new business opportunities. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a staggering amount of work ahead. That means you have an unprecedented opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most important work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Stripe Commercial (Mid-Market) Account Executive partners with high-growth, under-penetrated mid-market businesses to help them scale and modernize their financial infrastructure. These companies—often tech-forward, founder-led, and rapidly scaling—represent Stripe&#39;s next generation of breakout users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe Commercial AEs are responsible for both acquiring new users and expanding existing relationships. They guide companies through the full sales lifecycle, uncovering pain points, aligning on solutions across the Stripe product suite, and driving long-term value. Commercial AEs serve as strategic advisors, helping users unlock new revenue, streamline operations, and launch ambitious new products on top of the Stripe platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial AEs own a book of high-potential accounts—some already using Stripe, others still evaluating. They operate with a dual motion—hunting for new growth opportunities and farming existing relationships for deeper adoption and expansion. They work cross-functionally with Solutions, Product, Post-Sales, and Sales Ops to craft tailored strategies and execute at high velocity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-potential, fast-growing eCommerce platforms for a full-stack Stripe implementation, from payments to Connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a product and pricing workshop with an existing user to introduce Radar and optimize their fraud stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute an outbound play to target a new vertical in their region or territory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and deliver compelling product walkthroughs to showcase how the expanding Stripe product suite (like Issuing or Treasury) maps to customer goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive commercial discussions and close complex, high-impact deals—both net-new and upsell&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Success and Solutions Architects to resolve user pain points and deepen Stripe integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share feedback with Product and Marketing teams to help inform roadmap and messaging prioritie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 years of experience in solution sales field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High professional fluency in Japanese and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand complex requirements and craft custom solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving and quantitative capabilities including comfort with basic financial modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate in a highly ambiguous and fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to understand the Stripe API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Excel and SQL, or a willingness to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

