&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NrSYd8kjeoNTrexRDNsuNpZOsMd&quot;&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AiPQdXfdFoecDex1OG7lJgYoghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Nd1YddOf3o99s6xGyGOlNcUCggd&quot;&gt;You will be responsible for the core architecture design and technical delivery of an enterprise-grade AI Native engineering platform, driving the deep integration of large language models, AI Agents, knowledge capabilities, and the software development lifecycle. The platform will support intelligent capabilities across requirement analysis, solution generation, coding collaboration, test automation, and environment orchestration.This role focuses on engineering-grade AI implementation in complex R&amp;amp;D scenarios. You are expected to turn model capabilities into reusable, scalable, and governable platform capabilities, and continuously drive the evolution of the engineering platform toward an AI Native architecture.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GEUbd7sWzobkyGxnNNAufQyQsXe&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-HytwdMMd1o5PQtxqi9QudDSMsWV&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AiPQdXfdFoecDex1OG7lJgYoghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xyr9do8rioqlGnxj2f7l9m8OgNg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lead the &lt;strong&gt;overall architecture design and core capability development&lt;/strong&gt; of the AI Agent platform, including task orchestration, tool invocation, context management, memory mechanisms, and multi-agent collaboration.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AGtodpwc4oyxNXxCZucltduegFd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive the &lt;strong&gt;implementation of AI Native capabilities in engineering workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, including AI coding, technical solution generation, test case generation, test report generation, and automated environment deployment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TE3bdij1KomboGx7W2hlhVCegdg&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build the &lt;strong&gt;knowledge augmentation layer&lt;/strong&gt; for the platform, including the design, integration, and application of RAG, GraphRAG, and knowledge graph capabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DSLBdACIyoCRhlxPKgIlqAQcgPf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
