&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxgHdnPdooozcuxyxKKlRkKIgah&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate with product, engineering, QA, and operations teams to standardize, productionize, and scale platform capabilities, continuously improving engineering efficiency and delivery quality.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
