&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DvBDd012CobuoaxQtOkl2bQugqf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years&lt;/strong&gt; of experience in backend engineering, platform engineering, or infrastructure engineering, with strong system design and delivery capabilities.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BUnRdrwBOopOKLxw0kpl4y28gkd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
